# beyond its footprint is the evidence. Drawn from each tool's documentation
# or source (2026-11-05); `confidence` says how sure. `registry_env` names the
# variables a project points the tool at another registry with, whose hosts
# join the footprint at run time. A task adds to its toolchain's with
# `footprint` in the manifest.

